      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a delay. i look at people now and i realize i've done all i can do. my contribution is complete. there's no more 'fixing' to be done, and just sitting here waiting for my body to naturally fail feels like a waste of time. like i'm just dragging out a conclusion that's already been written. doesnt it feel strange to just stay around when the purpose is gone?",
